### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/openapi


### Local login - success
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "maxlogin",
  "password": "test123"
}

> {% client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken); %}


### Local login - wrong password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "maxlogin",
  "password": "wrong"
}


### Local login - unknown user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "unknownuser",
  "password": "test123"
}


### Local login with blank username - bad request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "test123"
}


### Local login with malformed body - bad request
